WEBVTT

00:00:00.027 --> 00:00:05.908
No fixture entered yet?
Start with the player’s observation.

00:00:05.908 --> 00:00:08.905
Choose New match
and its grade.

00:00:08.905 --> 00:00:14.836
Enter the match’s start date,
format and opposition.

00:00:14.836 --> 00:00:24.548
Choose your assessment
and add a useful note.

00:00:24.548 --> 00:00:26.543
Save. This creates the match
without selecting a team.

00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:30.922
The same fixture is ready
for the normal Teams selection.

00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:35.608
Team not finalised.
Your earlier observation is still saved.
